text SteffIntro_Hozier {
    "STEFF: The show was so good, I sang so\n"
    "loud I almost passed out… \p"
    "But I would do it again! $"
}

text SteffDefeated_Hozier{
    "Put me back in it…$"
}

text SteffPostBattle_Hozier{
    "STEFF: I don't want to leave just yet. \p"
    "If I leave it'll be over for real.$"
}

